 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology",
 "title": "SS52 to SS520: 5 A Schottky barrier rectifiers, 20 V to 200 V, in SMA (DO-214AC)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A family of nine single Schottky rectifiers in the DO-214AC (SMA) surface-mount package, rated 5 A average forward current and 120 A surge, with peak reverse ratings from 20 V (SS52) to 200 V (SS520). The junction carries a guard ring against overvoltage. Applications: high-speed switching, circuit protection and voltage clamping. SS510 is the 100 V member: 0.85 V maximum forward drop at 5 A, 0.05 mA maximum reverse leakage at rated voltage and 25 °C, and a junction rated to 150 °C.",
